WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:05,880
It's broken over there

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,720
Encountered a mixed group of wild boars

3
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,160
Sir, step back slowly

4
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,240
Meet up with Brother Wang

5
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:18,130
It's the police, right? We are the police. Girl, don't be afraid to stay where you are.

6
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,850
Shrink down to protect your own team.

7
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,550
Do you want to fire the gun first? Try not to fire the gun.

8
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:27,470
The sound of gunfire will only disturb them. They will confront each other first and continue to suppress them.

9
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:29,350
If they think we are not easy to mess with, they will retreat.

10
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:31,670
But as long as they have offensive intentions, shoot decisively

11
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:35,770
The key point is just below the midpoint of the line connecting the ears. That’s where the brain beats others to death.

12
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:53,630
Didn't you get hurt if I lured Zhu Yiquan to you?

13
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:55,030
It's okay. Didn't encounter it.

14
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:57,190
My reaction is really not slow
